{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/egonSchiele/agency-lang/pull/131","repo":"egonSchiele/agency-lang","number":131,"set":"agent","source":"amp","title":"Add @agency-lang/whisper-local package","body":"## Summary\n\nAdds a new `@agency-lang/whisper-local` package that provides local audio transcription for Agency programs using a vendored copy of [whisper.cpp](https://github.com/ggerganov/whisper.cpp) v1.7.6 and a custom N-API addon. No network calls at transcription time, no cloud dependency, and no `postinstall` script.\n\n## Architecture\n\nThree layers:\n\n1. **`.agency` wrapper** (`index.agency`) — thin Agency surface (`transcribe(path)`, `loadModel(name)`).\n2. **TypeScript orchestrator** (`src/`) — resolves model paths, decodes audio via `ffmpeg` to 16kHz mono PCM, manages model downloads and verification.\n3. **C++ N-API addon** (`src/addon.cc`) — runs whisper inference on a libuv worker thread.\n\n```diagram\n╭─────────────────╮     ╭──────────────────╮     ╭─────────────────╮\n│  index.agency   │────▶│  TS orchestrator │────▶│  N-API addon    │\n│ (Agency facade) │     │ (model + ffmpeg) │     │ (whisper.cpp)   │\n╰─────────────────╯     ╰──────────────────╯     ╰─────────────────╯\n```\n\n## Security posture\n\n- **No `postinstall` script.** Users explicitly opt in by running `npx agency-whisper build` to compile the native addon.\n- **HTTPS-only model downloads** with **SHA-256 verification** against a committed `models.lock.json` pinned to a specific HuggingFace commit.\n- whisper.cpp is **vendored** at `packages/whisper-local/vendor/` so the entire native dependency is reviewable in-tree.\n\n## C++ memory safety\n\n`TranscribeWorker` is built around three explicit invariants, each with direct test coverage in `tests/addon-memory.test.ts`:\n\n- **`Napi::Persistent` ref to the parent `WhisperModel`** — prevents JS GC from freeing the model while a worker thread is mid-inference (use-after-free).\n- **Atomic in-flight counter** — `free()` refuses to run while any transcribe call is outstanding.\n- **Per-model `std::mutex`** — concurrent `transcribe()` calls on the same model serialize cleanly instead of racing on `whisper_full`'s internal state.\n\nSee `packages/whisper-local/docs/DEV.md` for the full architecture, design rationale, and gotchas.\n\n## CLI\n\n`agency-whisper` ships with subcommands:\n\n- `build`   — compile the native addon\n- `pull`    — download and verify a model\n- `list`    — show installed models\n- `verify`  — re-verify a model against the lockfile\n\n## Tests\n\n- **46 unit tests** covering `modelManager`, `ffmpeg`, `transcribe`, `ensureModel`, the CLI, and C++ memory safety.\n- **1 gated integration test** (`AGENCY_RUN_SLOW=1`) that downloads `tiny.en` and transcribes a real WAV file end-to-end (verified locally with Metal acceleration on macOS).\n\n## CI\n\nDedicated workflow at `.github/workflows/whisper-local.yml` with path filtering — only runs on changes under `packages/whisper-local/`.\n\n## Codebase conventions followed\n\n- `type` instead of `interface`\n- plain objects instead of `Map`\n- no dynamic imports\n\nAmp-Thread-ID: https://ampcode.com/threads/T-019e1a79-2fb5-73db-91f2-457e9d0f1fec\n","authorType":"User","additions":213865,"deletions":4,"changedFiles":653,"files":[{"path":".github/workflows/whisper-local.yml","additions":67,"deletions":0},{"path":"packages/agency-lang/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-11-whisper-local.md","additions":2488,"deletions":0},{"path":"packages/agency-lang/docs/superpowers/specs/2026-05-11-whisper-local-design.md","additions":249,"deletions":0},{"path":"packages/agency-lang/hello.wav","additions":0,"deletions":0},{"path":"packages/whisper-local/CMakeLists.txt","additions":51,"deletions":0},{"path":"packages/whisper-local/README.md","additions":123,"deletions":0},{"path":"packages/whisper-local/docs/DEV.md","additions":397,"deletions":0},{"path":"packages/whisper-local/index.agency","additions":32,"deletions":0},{"path":"packages/whisper-local/make